{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880240/extras/865346a94b662861862fa13f589a1d5b.poster.avif?t=1753082857\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880240/extras/865346a94b662861862fa13f589a1d5b.webm?t=1753082857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880240/extras/865346a94b662861862fa13f589a1d5b.mp4?t=1753082857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mr Figs is a challenging top-down action puzzler where you play as Mr Figs - an adorable squid-like humanoid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Armed with as many bombs as you can carry. Blast,\u00a0manoeuvre and puzzle your way out of countless levels and areas trying to reach the depths below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What's in the demo?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The complete first area!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30+ levels to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzles and aha moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secrets (shh don't tell anyone)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Great! What's in the full game?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The same great experience but spread across WAY more content:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">120+ levels across 4 different areas to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More secrets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Puzzle yourself out of tricky situations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted lo